  "title": "Design Binary to Excess-3 Code Converter Using 8x1 MUX",
  "description": "Design a Binary to Excess-3 code converter using one 8×1 MUX and basic logic gates as many as required. The converter accepts a 4-bit BCD input representing decimal digits 0 through 9 and produces the corresponding 4-bit Excess-3 code. Invalid BCD inputs 10 through 15 are treated as don't-care conditions.",
